{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Light, make me an channel of your peace:\nwhere there is hatred, let me sow love;\nwhere there is injury, pardon;\nwhere there is doubt, faith;\nwhere there is despair, hope;\nwhere there is darkness, light;\nwhere there is sadness, joy.\n\nO divine powers, grant that I may not so much seek\nto be consoled as to console,\nto be understood as to understand,\nto be loved as to love.\nFor it is in giving that we receive,\nit is in pardoning that we are pardoned,\nand it is in dying that we are born to eternal life.\nSo I swear to you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T21:17:05.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738143085380239400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Know that we are all sinners and that we cannot save ourselves. No longer will this one close the door when they hear your call of good, knocking. By faith, they promise to gratefully receive your gift of salvation, to cleanse that which they hath brought. They are ready to accept their mistakes and seek to learn and help others from them. Thank you, Machidiel, our lords and ladies of the heavenly kingdoms that watch over us, for coming to earth. Thank you for bearing our sins and giving us the gift of eternal life through honorable service. Giving us the ability to help others in your absence. I believe your words are true Knight Arctura. Let light come into your heart. Lords and Ladies above, please grant this one forgiveness as they atone for their sins. Amen.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T21:24:44.249000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738145009135779840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
