{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"“I’m just tired Florian... that court case was needless to say rough... I don’t think that captain understood what I was trying to do by charging Goan with collusion, and on top of that I...” castor shudders “I apologized”","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:54:53.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738197897996271696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
