{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"“Damn... did you recover properly? Or did the knights help you?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T01:04:53.272000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738200411793653883","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"An older woman took me in, she taught me to live with honor and help others. Me being a free spirit, you could imagine how difficult it would be to learn these codes. However she taught me of her order and how to use a rapier\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T01:05:42.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738200617130131457","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Then it was my time to get tested\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T01:05:57.216000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738200679994228777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"“Well I’m glad you did I don’t think I would stand much chance here if it weren’t for someone like you who understands my journey and character”","created_at":"2020-07-30T01:06:31.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738200825611944017","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"I was terrified you see. I had caused so much pain unto others and became a part of an organization that even killed other people.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T01:08:10.611000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738201239493410847","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
